1. What this website is: a digital platform where you can discover, read, organize, or purchase comic books and graphic novels online. These websites vary widely depending on whether you want to read digital issues, catalog your physical collection, or just catch up on pop culture.
2. How it uses the data files in data: We will use the data from https://huggingface.co/datasets/common-pile/pressbooks_filtered (download and put it into data). We will not use the full data, but to sampled a subset for our website. 
